     "time": "2026-11-07T04:30:41+13:00",
     "img": "https://a.ltrbxd.com/resized/sm/upload/vd/2f/k7/nn/64VAgcAtGHBccnBQBur1Z2HRLAC-0-960-0-540-crop-fill.jpg?k=3cdfc02f3f",
     "intro": "With Club Kid exploding into theaters, writer-director-star Jordan Firstman tells Ella Kemp about club culture across oceans, the found families of queer people, the one scene he fought to keep—and the movie Sean Baker…",
     "category": "Interview"
